# The image's own ignore file, which replaces the root .dockerignore for it. Deny
# everything, then admit what the build reads: the wheelhouse, the shared uv entry
# point, and the double's project, source, fixtures, certificates and TLS generator.
# No environment, cache or build output of the project enters the context, nor a
# leaf key `make tls` wrote locally: the build generates its own.

*

!.dist/

!scripts/
scripts/*
!scripts/uv_project.py

!tools/
tools/*
!tools/payments-lane-double/
tools/payments-lane-double/*
!tools/payments-lane-double/pyproject.toml
!tools/payments-lane-double/uv.lock
!tools/payments-lane-double/README.md
!tools/payments-lane-double/src/
!tools/payments-lane-double/fixtures/
!tools/payments-lane-double/tls/
tools/payments-lane-double/tls/double.key.pem

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
